                            <span class="conn-status-dot"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="conn-node-meta">India AI Mission, Small Language Models on-device, and UPI global connectivity.</div>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" style="margin-top:10px; width:100%; font-size:11px; padding:6px 0;">&#128240; Send Tech News</button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="conn-node-card" style="cursor:pointer;" onclick="dispatchTgBroadcast('amazon')">
                        <div class="conn-node-header">
                            <div class="conn-node-title">🛒 Amazon Deals &amp; Drops</div>
                            <span class="conn-status-dot"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="conn-node-meta">Active price drop alerts, verified developer hardware and books watch list.</div>
