                • Overdue Price Checks Refreshed: <b>${d.overdue_price_checks}</b><br>
                • Duplicate Reminders Coalesced: <b>${d.reminders_coalesced}</b><br>
                • Failed Retries: <b>${d.failed_retries}</b><br>
                • Ledger Run ID: <code>${d.run_id}</code><br>
